%N A126416 Number of base 29 n-digit numbers with adjacent digits differing by two or less.
%C A126416 [Empirical] a(base,n)=a(base-1,n)+5^(n-1) for base>=2n-1; a(base,n)=a(base-1,n)+5^(n-1)-2 when base=2n-2
%H A126416 Rafał Wiktorowicz, <a href="/A126371/a126371_1.pdf">Proofs of the conjectured recurrences and generating functions for the adjacent-digits family</a>, 2026.
%H A126416 <a href="/index/Rec#order_15">Index entries for linear recurrences with constant coefficients</a>, signature (16,-90,172,179,-925,243,1605,-791,-1232,622,419,-175,-54,12,2).
%o A126416 (S/R) stvar $[N]:(0..M-1) init $[]:=0 asgn $[]->{*} kill +[i in 0..N-2](($[i]`-$[i+1]`>2)+($[i+1]`-$[i]`>2))
%Y A126416 Cf. Base 29 differing by one or less A126383.
%K A126416 nonn,base
%O A126416 0,2
